useToolRun: FOUNDATION says status: idle|ok|error|stale|running but RunStatus type has no 'running' and DkStatusBar may support running. That's a doc/impl inconsistency (FOUNDATION claims running). Let me confirm DkStatusBar. Also the state machine race: `markOk` sets status='ok' then `lastSig = getSignature()`. The watch is not immediate and triggers on change. Fine. But the "stale" transition: watch triggers asynchronously (Vue watchers flush 'pre' by default, before render, on next tick). If user modifies input and immediately clicks copy before watcher flushes... unlikely. 

Also stale: when status is 'idle' (before first run) and signature changes, armed false so nothing. After markFail, status='error', then signature changes -> 'stale'. In stale state, errorMsg is retained, staleNote set. DkStatusBar shows stale. The "retry" executes. OK.

